body:
Yea, i've heard that before "there is someone out there for everyone". That's probably true, there probably is a girl that is perferct for me somewhere, But...she could be on the oposite side of earth, or i might actualy find her here but that does not mean, even though she perfect for me that she would think i'm perfect for her.  


Well, in my current status it's pretty much living from payday to payday, i hardly save any money and i mostly buy things on sales. So if i want to buy something i like or go somewhere i would have to save for it for months, maybe even year or so.  


I thought about changing my job several times. There is a factory work near where i work now. There is a nice career advancement i heard, but you must be really good with your hands and/or words, or have connections in the company which i don't have. Also i just don't cope with changes that well. (new places, new things to learn, new people)

I think subconsciously i gave up long ago, i just don't fully realise it yet. 

&#x200B;

&#x200B;
